sequenceDiagram
    participant ES as Event Service
    participant K1 as Kafka (event.occurred)
    participant FS as Fan-out Service
    participant DB as Subscriber DB
    participant K2 as Kafka (notif.push / notif.email)
    participant NS as Notification Service
    participant APNS as APNs / FCM

    ES->>K1: publish {eventId: "e123", eventType: "NEW_VIDEO"}
    K1->>FS: consume event
    FS->>DB: SELECT user_id, device_token FROM subscribers\nWHERE event_id = "e123" (batches of 1000)
    DB-->>FS: [userId1, userId2, ... userId5M]
    loop for each user batch
        FS->>K2: publish {notifId, userId, deviceToken, message}
    end
    K2->>NS: consume notification message
    NS->>NS: check Redis SET sent:notifId NX
    alt already sent
        NS-->>NS: skip (duplicate)
    else not sent
        NS->>APNS: send push {deviceToken, payload}
        alt APNs success
            APNS-->>NS: 200 OK
        else APNs failure
            NS->>K2: publish to notif.retry\n{notifId, attempt: 1}
        end
    end
